      "value": "B-ASC - BACnet Application Specific Controller"
    },
    "productDescription": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "A BACnet/IP Application Specific Controller built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents three read-only sensor objects (Analog Input, Binary Input, Multi-State Input) and three commandable output objects (Analog Output, Binary Output, Multi-State Output), answers ReadProperty for every required property of every object, accepts WriteProperty to the commandable outputs' Present_Value (refusing values out of range) and acts on the winning command through a simulated valve, relay and drive whose feedback the input objects report, reports a disconnected valve through Analog Output 1's Reliability and Status_Flags FAULT, announces itself with an I-Am heartbeat that DeviceCommunicationControl silences and resumes, and is discoverable by Who-Is / I-Am and Who-Has / I-Have. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-ASC profile."
    },
    "productName": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ASC"
    },
