      "notes": "The Device object is the only object whose identity can change, and only by start-up configuration: restart the example with --deviceID <n> or --deviceName <text>. A WriteProperty to the Device's Object_Name or Object_Identifier is refused (write-access-denied), so nothing changes over the network.",
